// posture automatic (#113; patching-hosts policy.md § automatic): unattended-upgrades
// takes -security daily, from apt-daily-upgrade.timer, and never reboots. Installed
// by hand as /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/processor-periodic (docs/PATCHING.md § Patching).
// apt reads apt.conf.d in name order: this name sorts after the image's
// docker-disable-periodic-update, which sets Enable "0". A 99… name sorts before it.
// The two lines 20auto-upgrades already sets are restated, so this file alone says
// what the posture needs. Origins stay 50unattended-upgrades' (-security, the release
// pocket, ESM security): apply.sh refuses wider ones. needrestart lists, never
// restarts: deploy/needrestart.conf.d/processor.conf.
APT::Periodic::Enable "1";
APT::Periodic::Update-Package-Lists "1";
APT::Periodic::Unattended-Upgrade "1";
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot "false";
